[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0967","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0967.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0648","title":"通用 X.25 服务运行配置问题（此编号已废弃，不构成安全漏洞）","description":"tags.<value>CVE-1999-0648 候选编号已被驳回，原因为该条目描述的是\"X25 服务正在运行\"这一系统配置状态，并非直接引入安全漏洞的缺陷类型。此类配置类问题更适合收录于通用配置枚举（CCE）体系。该候选编号不应被用于安全漏洞追踪，其 CVSS 评分为 0，不具备实际可利用的攻击条件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0648"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"如非必要，建议在系统配置中禁用 X.25 服务（如 Solaris 中停止 x25 相关 daemon，Linux 中移除或封锁 x25 内核模块），或在网络边界防火墙封禁 TCP 端口 2000/2001 以限制外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/92d64b4c9b3c5a0ce1fd1e5f8c017b9772e0139b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0648.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0648","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0648.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0648.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5c36feecacaa0eef96caef76eb433e2bf57c7235/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-06xx/CVE-1999-0648.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv","https://github.com/Software-Engineering-2026-Class/kelompok4-cyber-kg-agentic/blob/0fc3a7d1e2416617ef834c956997e1f0f283424b/parser_agent/output/cve.ttl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0967.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0966","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0966.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0647","title":"UNIX bootparamd 服务运行配置问题","description":"bootparamd（引导参数服务）是一种基于 RPC 的传统网络服务，用于向无盘客户端提供引导参数。该服务运行于系统中时，可能被远程攻击者利用来探测网络配置与主机信息，造成信息泄露。由于其本身不直接引入安全漏洞，更适合归入通用配置枚举（CCE）进行管理。建议在非必要环境中禁用该服务以减少攻击面。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0647"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"建议在服务器上禁用 bootparamd 服务，该服务用于无盘工作站启动，在现代网络中已无必要且可能泄露系统信息。执行 `killall bootparamd` 并禁止随系统启动（删除或注释相关 inetd 条目）。若确实需要，应在防火墙中限制 RPC 端口 (111/udp) 仅允许受信任子网访问，或配置 hosts.allow/hosts.deny 进行访问控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/92d64b4c9b3c5a0ce1fd1e5f8c017b9772e0139b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0647.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0647","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0647.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0647.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000468.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5c36feecacaa0eef96caef76eb433e2bf57c7235/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-06xx/CVE-1999-0647.json","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/1b758e4b71978ff973a6df1bc69fc70b932735fb/advisories/2000/02/EUVD-1999-0630.json","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0966.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0965","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0965.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0646","title":"LDAP 服务配置暴露风险","description":"CVE-1999-0646 已被撤销（REJECTED），不再作为安全漏洞使用。该候选编号的原始描述为 LDAP 服务正在运行，仅涉及 LDAP 协议服务的配置暴露情况，并非直接的安全漏洞，不满足 CVE 漏洞收录标准。NVD 官方说明指出该条目更适合归入通用配置枚举（CCE）体系进行管理，因此该编号已被废弃。此条目不涉及任何可利用的安全缺陷，不存在攻击条件或利用方式。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0646"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"如非业务必需，建议禁用 LDAP 匿名绑定，配置 LDAPS（LDAP over SSL/TLS）代替明文 LDAP（端口 389），并在防火墙层面限制只有信任网络可访问 LDAP 端口（389/636）。同时启用访问控制列表（ACL）和账户密码策略，防止信息泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/92d64b4c9b3c5a0ce1fd1e5f8c017b9772e0139b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0646.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0646","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0646.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0646.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5c36feecacaa0eef96caef76eb433e2bf57c7235/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-06xx/CVE-1999-0646.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv","https://github.com/Software-Engineering-2026-Class/kelompok4-cyber-kg-agentic/blob/0fc3a7d1e2416617ef834c956997e1f0f283424b/parser_agent/output/cve.ttl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0965.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0964","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0964.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0645","title":"IRC 服务运行信息泄露漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0645 已被拒绝使用，原分配描述为\"IRC 服务正在运行\"，该条目实质描述的是系统中 IRC 服务处于启用状态的配置信息，而非本身存在安全漏洞。由于此类配置枚举更适合归入通用配置枚举（CCE）体系，NVD 已将其标记为 REJECT 状态。系统管理员应关注 IRC 服务是否确实需要运行，若无需使用建议关闭以减小攻击面。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0645"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:00Z","remediation":"在服务器上禁用不必要的 IRC 服务。Linux 系统执行 systemctl disable ircd 并停止对应服务；Windows 系统通过 services.msc 将 IRC 相关服务设为禁用。在边界防火墙上封禁 IRC 默认端口 6660-6669/TCP 的出站流量，防止内网主机外连 IRC 服务器。定期使用端口扫描确认 6660-6669 端口无对外开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/92d64b4c9b3c5a0ce1fd1e5f8c017b9772e0139b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0645.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0645","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0645.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0645.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5c36feecacaa0eef96caef76eb433e2bf57c7235/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-06xx/CVE-1999-0645.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv","https://github.com/Software-Engineering-2026-Class/kelompok4-cyber-kg-agentic/blob/0fc3a7d1e2416617ef834c956997e1f0f283424b/parser_agent/output/cve.ttl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0964.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0960","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0960.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0642","title":"Multiple Vendors POP Service 未授权访问漏洞","description":"该漏洞条目原描述为目标系统运行了 POP（Post Office Protocol）邮件服务，该服务默认监听 TCP 110 端口。运行 POP 服务本身并不构成直接安全漏洞，但在配置不当（如未启用加密、使用弱口令认证、暴露于公网）的情况下，远程攻击者可能通过暴力破解或会话劫持等方式获取邮件内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该条目已被 CVE 官方驳回，认为其属于通用配置枚举（CCE）范畴而非安全漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0642"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:59Z","remediation":"如非业务必需，建议在服务器上禁用 POP3 服务（如 CentOS: `systemctl disable dovecot`；Ubuntu: `systemctl disable pop3`）；如确需使用，限制仅允许加密连接（启用 TLS/SSL，设置 `ssl = required`），并在防火墙层面限制仅允许受信 IP 访问 TCP 端口 110。同时建议使用 IMAPS（端口 993）替代明文 POP3。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/92d64b4c9b3c5a0ce1fd1e5f8c017b9772e0139b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0642.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0642","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0642.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0642.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5c36feecacaa0eef96caef76eb433e2bf57c7235/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-06xx/CVE-1999-0642.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv","https://github.com/Software-Engineering-2026-Class/kelompok4-cyber-kg-agentic/blob/0fc3a7d1e2416617ef834c956997e1f0f283424b/parser_agent/output/cve.ttl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0960.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0956","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0956.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0640","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9093,\"outputTokens\":22,\"totalTokens\":10779}}","description":"目标主机上运行了 Gopher 服务，该服务会在未经身份认证的情况下向任意远程访问者暴露目标系统的服务状态与网络信息，属于信息泄露类配置弱点。影响范围为所有默认或手动开启 Gopher（TCP 70 端口）服务的 Unix 类系统。攻击者只需具备网络可达性，即可通过连接该端口探测主机运行状态、确认服务指纹并扩大后续攻击面。虽然 Gopher 服务本身不直接导致代码执行，但其开放状态会降低系统隐蔽性，建议关闭不必要的 Gopher 服务以消除信息暴露风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0640"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:46Z","remediation":"建议立即禁用 Gopher 服务（gopherd），在 /etc/inetd.conf 或 /etc/xinetd.d/gopher 中注释或移除相关配置行，重启 inetd/xinetd 服务使变更生效。如系统捆绑 Gopher 服务，建议升级到不再包含该服务的操作系统版本。同时应在网络边界防火墙封禁 TCP 端口 70（Gopher 默认端口），防止外部访问该服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0640","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/84f82928c38b4d0e02149dbde07f5affc7f46f43/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0640.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0640","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0640.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc528fa33408da88ea19cf3d01d2185cd0ffe95a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0640.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-84x2-992j-4cgr/GHSA-84x2-992j-4cgr.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0640.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83127/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0640.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0956.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0954","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0954.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0639","title":"Unix/Linux chargen 服务未授权访问漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0639 涉及 Unix 系统上运行的多个网络服务存在远程安全漏洞。其中 chargen（字符生成）服务在目标主机上处于开启状态，该服务属于经典的\"无用服务\"，会在收到连接后持续返回随机字符流。攻击者可通过向目标主机的 chargen 端口（TCP/UDP 19）建立连接，诱导其产生大量无意义流量，并可结合 echo 等服务发起反射放大攻击，消耗系统资源或参与分布式拒绝服务（DDoS）。影响范围为默认开启或暴露此类老旧服务的 Unix/Linux 系统。利用条件为攻击者能够网络可达目标主机的 chargen 端口，且服务未做访问限制。建议关闭并禁用 chargen 等不必要的网络服务以减小攻击面。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0639"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:46Z","remediation":"在 inetd/xinetd 配置中注释掉 chargen 服务条目（如 /etc/inetd.conf 中 #chargen 及 /etc/xinetd.d/chargen 设置 disable = yes），执行 kill -HUP $(pidof inetd) 或重启 xinetd 使配置生效；同时在边界防火墙阻断 TCP/UDP 19 端口，禁止外部访问该服务以消除反射放大与信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0639","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0639.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/84f82928c38b4d0e02149dbde07f5affc7f46f43/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0639.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0639","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc528fa33408da88ea19cf3d01d2185cd0ffe95a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0639.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0639.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gccm-p8cf-fqwm/GHSA-gccm-p8cf-fqwm.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0639.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83127/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0954.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0952","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0952.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0638","title":"Unix Daytime 服务暴露漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0638 涉及 Unix 系统上运行的多个网络服务存在远程安全漏洞。其中 daytime 服务（端口 13）在目标主机上处于开启状态，该服务会响应 TCP/UDP 请求并返回当前系统时间字符串。攻击条件为攻击者能够与暴露该服务的目标主机建立网络连接，利用方式是通过向 daytime 服务发送探测请求以确认服务存活并收集目标系统信息，从而辅助后续侦察与攻击。该漏洞本身危害较低，主要影响运行了不必要网络服务的 Unix 系统，暴露了多余的服务端口，增加了攻击面。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0638"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:46Z","remediation":"在 inetd/xinetd 配置中注释掉 daytime 服务条目（如 /etc/inetd.conf 中的 daytime stream tcp nowait 行并执行 kill -HUP 重启 inetd），或使用防火墙规则（如 iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 13 -j DROP）屏蔽 TCP/UDP 13 端口，关闭不必要的 daytime 服务以减小信息泄露与攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0638","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/84f82928c38b4d0e02149dbde07f5affc7f46f43/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0638.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0638","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0638.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc528fa33408da88ea19cf3d01d2185cd0ffe95a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0638.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vpq5-qv66-5v8c/GHSA-vpq5-qv66-5v8c.json","https://github.com/scipag/AttackToolKit/blob/78bf88564956b8f18a37659dc3d345093e95a136/plugins/Daytime%20service%20tcp%20detection.plugin","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0638.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83127/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0952.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0950","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0950.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0637","title":"Unix systat 服务 多个远程安全漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0637 指 Unix 系统上开启的 systat 远程服务存在信息泄露类安全漏洞。systat 服务（通常监听 TCP 11 端口）会在收到连接请求时返回系统当前进程状态、CPU 与内存占用等敏感信息，且默认无需任何身份认证即可访问。远程攻击者只需与目标主机建立 TCP 连接并发送请求，即可在未授权情况下获取主机运行状态与进程清单，进而辅助侦察与进一步攻击。该漏洞影响默认启用 systat 服务的各类 Unix/Linux 系统，利用条件仅为网络可达且服务端口开放，危害虽不直接导致代码执行，但显著增加了系统被探测与定向攻击的风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0637"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:46Z","remediation":"建议在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释或删除 systat 服务所在行（通常为 systat stream tcp nowait root /usr/sbin/systat），然后重启 inetd 或 xinetd 服务使配置生效。如使用 systemd 系统，执行 systemctl disable systat 并停止对应服务。作为替代监控方案，可使用 netstat、ss 等本地命令查看系统状态。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0637","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0637.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1ef693821096ed2e21366dae590c013e3dc540aa/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0637.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0637","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc528fa33408da88ea19cf3d01d2185cd0ffe95a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0637.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0637.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8m5f-mgpp-868h/GHSA-8m5f-mgpp-868h.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0637.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83127/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0950.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0948","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0948.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0636","title":"Microsoft Windows Discard 服务权限提升漏洞","description":"目标系统上运行着不必要的 discard 网络服务（TCP/UDP 9 端口），该服务依据 RFC 863 定义仅接收并丢弃所有传入数据，本身不具备实际业务功能。该漏洞影响运行 inetd 或 xinetd 的类 Unix/Linux 系统，以及任何意外开放 9 端口的网络设备。攻击条件为攻击者能够通过网络访问目标主机的 9 端口且该服务处于监听状态。攻击者可利用该开放服务进行网络侦察以确认主机存活及服务运行状态，或在分布式拒绝服务攻击中将其作为 UDP 反射放大节点；当该服务以 root 等高权限运行时，还可被与其他漏洞链式利用，从而实现权限提升。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0636"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:46Z","remediation":"在 Windows NT/2000 中通过「控制面板→服务」停止并禁用 Discard（丢弃）服务，将其启动类型设为「已禁用」；同时在边界防火墙和主机 IPsec 策略上屏蔽 TCP/UDP 9 端口的入站流量，仅允许受信任内网访问以缓解暴露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0636","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1ef693821096ed2e21366dae590c013e3dc540aa/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0636.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0636","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0636.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc528fa33408da88ea19cf3d01d2185cd0ffe95a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0636.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q8p3-cw6v-69j8/GHSA-q8p3-cw6v-69j8.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0636.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2020/postel/gb_discard_useless_service.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0948.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0946","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0946.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0635","title":"通用网络系统 回声服务 未授权服务运行安全漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0635 指目标系统启用了 TCP/UDP 7 号端口的回声（echo）服务。该服务会原样回显接收到的任意数据，属于多余且危险的网络服务。攻击者在无需身份认证的情况下，即可向该端口发送数据触发回显，进而可用于反射放大攻击或探测网络拓扑。其影响范围为所有默认开启 echo 服务的主机（如部分老旧 Unix/Linux 及 Windows 系统），增大了被拒绝服务攻击利用的风险。修复方式为禁用或关闭系统的 echo 服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0635"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:45Z","remediation":"在 /etc/inetd.conf 或 xinetd.d/echo 配置文件中注释或删除 echo 服务（端口 7/tcp 和 7/udp）条目，执行 systemctl restart inetd 或 systemctl restart xinetd 使配置生效。若系统使用 systemd，可直接执行 systemctl disable --now echo.service 禁用并停止该服务。如无法立即禁用服务，可通过防火墙规则（iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 7 -j DROP）封禁端口 7 的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.grok.org.uk/pipermail/full-disclosure/2006-January/041434.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/18514","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0635.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1ef693821096ed2e21366dae590c013e3dc540aa/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0635.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0635","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc528fa33408da88ea19cf3d01d2185cd0ffe95a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0635.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0635.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/echo.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wghh-7w72-v3r8/GHSA-wghh-7w72-v3r8.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0635.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83127/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0946.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0945","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0945.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0634","title":"SSH 服务运行配置暴露","description":"CVE-1999-0634 已被拒绝使用。该编号原用于描述\"SSH 服务正在运行\"这一配置状态，但经评估该条目并非直接引入安全漏洞的缺陷，而属于安全配置管理范畴。此类配置项更适合纳入通用配置枚举（CCE）体系进行管理，因此 CVE 编号委员会决定拒绝此编号。该问题不涉及具体的攻击方法、漏洞原理或影响范围。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0634"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:59Z","remediation":"评估 SSH 服务是否必需，非必需则关闭 sshd 服务（systemctl disable sshd）；如需保留，配置密钥认证登录、禁用 root 直接登录（PermitRootLogin no）、修改默认端口 22 为高编号端口、限制来源 IP（hosts.allow/iptables），并保持 OpenSSH 为最新稳定版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1421f0a4349d5d46275cadd9c7c62349edf9c8bb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0634.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3